:: Carter Repeatable Lewd Intro [nobr]

/* Intro */
<span style="color:LightGreen">You and <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> begin playing a rousing game of <span style="color:lightsteelblue">“Hero Battles!”</span></span> Which is a game, as <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> explains it, where two heroes battle each other with their powers as a test a might. Basically, it is a reason for you two to jump around his room, playing pretend and <span style="color:lightsteelblue">“fighting”</span> one another without needing a whole made up reason about why two heroes would do battle. <span style="color:LightGreen">To skip all the fluff and just gets right to the action!</span> <br>

    <<set _ad to [
        {
            Name: "Player",
            State: {
                Mouth: "Smirk",
                Eyes: "Mad",
            },	
        },
        {
            Name: "Carter",
            State: {
                Outfit: "Everyday",
                Mouth: "Smirk",
                Eyes: "Mad",
            },	
        },
    ]>>
    <<ad _ad>>

<span style="color:lightsteelblue">“Come on! You can do better than that!”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> laughs as he delivers a devastating punch that sends you flying against the wall, the breath knocked out of you… at least, it is in your pretend world. <span style="color:lightsteelblue">“Ultraboy can’t be beat by such simple, easy attacks! Why don’t you show me what you really can do!”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> leaps up onto his bed, taking a fighting stance. As you slowly recover, you try to come up with a plan. The kid’s good, too good. His powerset is frankly completely overpowered. <span style="color:Yellow">Then again, you also know <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> has one specific weakness, and he isn’t always the sharpest knife in the pencil case.</span> <br>
<br>
You think fast, leaping forward and grabbing <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span>’s blanket, which sits under his feet, and yank it away! <span style="color:lightsteelblue">“Woah!”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> cries as he loses his balance and tumbles backward onto his bed. You then leap on top of him, <span style="color:Pink">yanking his shirt up to reveal his chest and tear away the source of his power. <span style="color:lightsteelblue">“Ahhh!”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> cries as you yank his shirt completely off of him. He holds his hands up in defeat,</span> <span style="color:lightsteelblue">“Okay, you win! I give!”</span> He laughs, some pink flushing on his cheeks, <span style="color:lightsteelblue">“That was a dirty move, but I respect it, haha…”</span> <br>
<br>
<span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> lies on the bed below you, hands above his head from his surrender. You’ve been making a lot of noise, and his family haven’t really appeared, so you’d guess they are either gone or occupied, meaning you both are practically alone. <span style="color:Pink">You smirk down at <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> whose blush only grows as you notice his legs squirming a little, no doubt a tingling growing in his groin as he finds himself stuck below you in a very familiar setting. You look to your left and see his handcuffs, sitting just within reach. <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> notices you looking at them and audibly gulps.</span> <br>

    <<set _ad to [
        {
            Name: "Player",
            State: {
                Mouth: "Smirk",
                Eyes: "Tired",
            },	
        },
        {
            Name: "Carter",
            State: {
                Outfit: "Everyday",
                Mouth: "Frown",
                Blush: 1,
                Arms: "Bound",
            },
            Clothes: {
                Top: $None,
                Outer: $None,
                Over: $None,
                Under: $None,
                },          
            },
        ]>>
    <<ad _ad>>

<span style="color:lightsteelblue">“Wha… what do you want to do now?”</span> He asks without looking away from the cuffs. <br>
<br>

<div id="choice">
	<<link "Cuff his hands and have some fun<br>">>
    <<replace "#choice">>
        With a devious smirk and a slight blush yourself, you grab the cuffs and, in one quick, flawless motion, <span style="color:Pink">cuffs <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span>’s hands to his bedpost, leaving him completely helpless and at your mercy in an instant.</span> <span style="color:lightsteelblue">“W- wait! Hold on!”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> tugs at the binds, though you note how he only has this reaction once he can’t get out of it. <span style="color:Pink">The boy either wasn’t expecting this and was caught completely off-guard or is just playing along in his own dirty fantasy. You have a good idea which one.</span> <br>
        <br>
        <span style="color:lightsteelblue">“Wh- wh- what are you going to do now?”</span> <span style="color:Pink"><span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> looks up at you, nervous yet very excited, as you find yourself once more in complete control of everything from the boy’s dignity to what levels of pleasure and pain he is about to experience.</span> <br>
        <<set $Sex to {
            Partner: "Carter",
            Clothing: "Clothed",
            LastAction: "None",
        }>>
        <br>
        <<include"Carter Repeatable Lewd Options">>
    <</replace>>
    <</link>>
	<<link "Decide to play something else<br>">>
    <<replace "#choice">>
        Whether you just don’t want to tease <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> and play lewd games, or you have something else in mind, you decide to leave the cuffs for now and get off <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span>, suggesting the two of you play another game or watch some TV. Your sudden rejection of playing with the boy in a naughty way seems to catch him off guard. <br>
        <br>
        <span style="color:lightsteelblue">“What? Oh, umm…”</span> He sits up, face bright pink as he places his hand over his crotch, no doubt having started to rock a stiffy from the idea of being helpless and played with by you again. <span style="color:LightGreen">Despite his disappointment, <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> seems excited to do something else and the two of you happily decide what next adventure awaits you.</span> <br>
        <br>
        [[Continue|Carter House Carter Bedroom]]
    <</replace>>
    <</link>>
</div>
